<title>UK: Bradford wool market report.</title>
<headline>Bradford wool market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bradford wool prices were unchanged as brokers waited for prices to be tested later this week in overseas markets.</p>
<p>Recent firmness in other markets saw buyers down the processing line holding back around the end of last week until nearby direction can be ascertained.</p>
<p>Very little fresh business was placed despite currency moves that indicated that prices ought to have risen to cover costs, as brokers felt unconfident without support from the wool market itself.</p>
<p>Deliveries though are going out well, brokers said.</p>
<p>--Stephen Grainger +44 0171 542 8074</p>
</text>
